stages=[('01','Reach relevant people','Create useful content, tools and relevant distribution around the work your customers need to do. Their questions and requests help you find who needs help.'),('02','Keep helping and listening','Follow questions, corrections and objections to recent events, existing workarounds and real costs. Learn which problems matter in practice.'),('03','Help buyers evaluate and buy','Research accounts, organize evidence and prepare materials for the people actually involved in purchasing. Keep open questions and next steps visible.'),('04','Make getting started easier','Organize approved guidance, training resources, responsibilities and handoffs so a new customer can find what they need.'),('05','Make support easier to use','Make checked answers easy to find. Route new questions to the right people and use recurring issues to inform service and product improvements.'),('06','Build on continued use','Use actual customer experience to improve service and support continued purchasing where relevant. Carry useful learning into the next relationship.')]
stage_html=''.join(f'<article><span class="step-number">{n}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>' for n,title,body in stages)
home=head('Make each customer interaction improve the next','Connect marketing, sales, training and customer support through a continuous service that learns from real work and final business results.','')+header+f'''<main id="main">
<section class="section loop-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER JOURNEY IMPROVEMENT</p><h1>Make each customer interaction <em>improve the next.</em></h1><p class="loop-lede">When customer knowledge stays in separate sales conversations, support messages and documents, the next buyer can face the same unanswered questions.</p><p>We help you improve the places where your business meets its customers, from useful content and sales conversations to training, everyday support and continued purchasing. We connect that work into one feedback system, run focused improvements with your team and carry useful findings into the next cycle.</p>{button()}<p class="loop-note">Bring one product, one customer group and a recent task.</p></div><aside class="loop-margin"><span class="eyebrow">ONE CONNECTED SERVICE</span><p>Marketing.<br>Sales.<br>Training.<br>Customer support.</p><span>Every interaction adds context for the next.</span></aside></section>
<section class="section loop-section" id="approach"><div class="loop-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE WHOLE CUSTOMER JOURNEY</p><h2>A sales funnel<br>that learns.</h2></div><p>Useful content and practical tools help relevant people find you. Continued help reveals their real tasks and questions. Those insights should carry through evaluation, purchasing, first use and ongoing support.</p></div><figure class="loop-figure"><a href="assets/customer-feedback-funnel-en-20261116.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="assets/customer-feedback-funnel-en-20261116.svg" width="1920" height="1080" alt="Six-stage customer funnel from reaching relevant people to repeat purchasing, surrounded by a loop to listen, check final results, retain learning and improve one factor."></a><figcaption><span>The people and steps depend on your product and its buying process.</span><a href="assets/customer-feedback-funnel-en-20261116.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the full-size funnel ↗</a></figcaption></figure><div class="loop-stage-grid">{stage_html}</div></section>
<section class="section loop-section" id="working-loop"><div class="loop-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTINUOUS IMPROVEMENT</p><h2>Connect the work.<br>Follow the result.</h2></div><p>Choose a real customer problem. Agree the intended result, comparison and observation period. Change one factor, carry out the work and follow what happens.</p></div><div class="loop-result"><div><span>WHAT THE BUSINESS KEEPS</span><p>The context, evidence, action and result, ready for the next task.</p></div><div><span>WHAT THE CHANGE IS JUDGED AGAINST</span><p>Paid purchases. Continued purchasing. Contribution after costs.</p></div></div><p class="loop-explanation">Customer questions and other observations help explain the process. The agreed final business result determines whether a change helps. We keep the conditions and uncertainty with each finding so your team can use it appropriately.</p></section>
<section class="section loop-section loop-knowledge"><div><p class="eyebrow">WORKING KNOWLEDGE YOUR COMPANY CAN KEEP</p><h2>Turn real questions<br>into useful experience.</h2></div><div><p>A customer's objection can reveal a missing explanation. A training question can expose an unclear handoff. A recurring support issue can point to a service or product improvement.</p><p>We organize these findings into a working record your team can maintain, use and export. Artificial intelligence helps with research, analysis and preparation. Your team reviews product-specific information and agrees the changes.</p><a class="loop-text-link" href="services.html">See the work we can deliver →</a></div></section>
<section class="section loop-section loop-start"><div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH REAL WORK</p><h2>One task can begin<br>a connected system.</h2><p>Bring one product, one customer group and a recent task. We'll discuss how that task connects to the wider journey, what help would be useful and how to evaluate the result.</p><p class="loop-note">Scope, timing, evidence, acceptance terms and fee are agreed before work begins. There is no advance service fee for the first agreed enterprise validation.</p><a class="loop-text-link" href="services.html#acceptance">Read first-project terms →</a></div><div>{button()}</div></section>
</main>'''+footer+'</body></html>'
(SITE/'index.html').write_text(home,encoding='utf-8',newline='\n')

deliverables=[('A map of the real journey','The actual participants, customer tasks, unanswered questions and handoffs across marketing, purchasing, first use and support.'),('Useful content and work tools','Articles, explainers, checklists and focused distribution that help relevant people find you and bring real questions into conversation.'),('Account and buying materials','Source-linked account research, relevant evidence, proposals and purchasing information for the people in the actual decision.'),('Onboarding and training resources','Organized, approved materials, clear responsibilities and learning resources. Product-use or clinical questions go to the appropriate qualified people.'),('A maintained support record','Customer questions, checked answers, unresolved issues and feedback that can inform service and product decisions.'),('A record of changes and results','The agreed change, its conditions, comparison, observation period, final result and implications for the next cycle.')]
