services=head('Customer journey improvement service','An ongoing service connecting customer research, marketing, sales, onboarding, training and support through final-result feedback.','services.html')+header+f'''<main id="main"><section class="section loop-page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">OUR SERVICE</p><h1>A continuous improvement service across your <em>customer journey.</em></h1><p class="loop-lede">Your company meets customers through content, sales conversations, purchasing, training and everyday support. Each encounter can reveal work that needs to be easier, an answer that is missing or a problem your product could solve better.</p><p>We connect those encounters into a working feedback system. Together, we select a meaningful change, prepare and carry out the work, follow the final business result and update the next interaction.</p>{button()}</section><section class="section loop-section"><div class="loop-section-heading"><h2>Practical work.<br>Connected learning.</h2><p>The deliverables depend on the product, customer and actual buying or use process. Work can start at one touchpoint and connect to others as priorities become clearer.</p></div><div class="loop-deliverables">{items}</div></section><section class="section loop-section loop-knowledge"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW ONGOING WORK OPERATES</p><h2>A clear cycle.<br>A useful company asset.</h2></div><div><p>Each cycle has an agreed scope, owner and review date. We change one factor, compare the final business results over an agreed period and retain the context and uncertainty.</p><p>Ongoing service covers defined monitoring, maintenance and new improvements. Your team keeps the working materials and records. Additional work is agreed before it begins.</p><p>Artificial intelligence assists research, analysis and preparation. Your team reviews product-specific information and agrees the actions. Specialist work, account access, data and responsibilities are defined for the actual engagement.</p></div></section><section class="section loop-section loop-knowledge"><div><p class="eyebrow">CHANNELS AND EXTERNAL COSTS</p><h2>Scope the work.<br>Keep costs visible.</h2></div><div><p>Content, channels and advertising are selected for the actual task and evidence. Where advertising management is included, the platform, campaigns, creative responsibilities and budget are agreed explicitly.</p><p>You control the account and pay media platforms directly. Third-party costs have a separate agreed payer and cap. Work already included in a project is not billed a second time.</p></div></section>{acceptance}<section class="section loop-section loop-start"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>Bring a recent<br>customer task.</h2><p>We'll discuss where it connects to the wider journey, what help would be useful and how to assess the result. A separate assessment purchase is optional.</p></div><div>{button()}</div></section></main>'''+footer+'</body></html>'
